OL,3,AUS inflation rises more than expected -
OL,4,Ahere's what is happening with prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS inflation rose by more than expected
OL,7,Fin the year to September, according to
OL,8,Fofficial figures, in the final data
OL,9,Frelease before the midterm elections
OL,10,Fnext month.
OL,12,FThe pace of price rises increased to
OL,13,F3.7%, up from 3.4% in the 12 months to
OL,14,FAugust.
OL,16,FInflation was above forecasts, driven
OL,17,Fby higher petrol prices, which have
OL,18,Frisen following disruption to Middle
OL,19,FEast energy supplies due to the
OL,20,FUS-Israel conflict with Iran.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
